cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use this software, please cite it as below, together with the
  ip3r_genes project whose results it re-derives.
type: software
title: "IP3R Structural Simulator"
abstract: >-
  An interactive, physics-based 3-D model of the inositol 1,4,5-trisphosphate
  receptor (IP3R) that measures its cryo-EM structures, morphs between gating
  states, runs gating, puff and ion-permeation models, and independently
  re-derives the published results of the ip3r_genes project.
authors:
  - family-names: Dickinson
    given-names: George
version: 0.1.0
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/gddickinson/ip3r-simulator"
keywords:
  - IP3 receptor
  - ITPR
  - calcium signalling
  - ion channel
  - cryo-EM
  - elastic network model
references:
  - type: software
    title: "ip3r_genes"
    abstract: >-
      Census, evolution and constraint of the IP3 receptor family: the
      publication project whose findings this simulator re-derives.
    authors:
      - family-names: Dickinson
        given-names: George
    repository-code: "https://github.com/gddickinson/ip3r_genes"
